    # s bbhabha "And now, when I'm a bit sad or out of it, {w=0.5}{nw}"
    s bbhabha "而现在，哪怕某些时候我会伤感、会失魂落魄，{w=0.5}{nw}"

# game/dialogs/script-poemresponses.rpy:105
