    # extend abfcaoa "Best of all, you're a real, non-scripted person who I can spend time with."
    extend abfcaoa "现在陪着我的是真实的、不被脚本控制的你，这可再好不过了。"

# game/dialogs/script-poemresponses.rpy:111
